 "lines": [
  {
   "section": "open",
   "text": "This is an airshow.",
   "start": 0.6,
   "end": 2.079
  },
  {
   "section": "open",
   "text": "And it is, I think, the finest way to spend a British summer's day.",
   "start": 2.779,
   "end": 7.11
  },
  {
   "section": "open",
   "text": "Provided you've actually managed to get here.",
   "start": 7.81,
   "end": 10.662
  },
  {
   "section": "open",
   "text": "As I was saying.",
   "start": 13.662,
   "end": 15.024
  },
  {
   "section": "slot2",
   "text": "I've been going to airshows since two thousand and six.",
   "start": 22.5,
   "end": 25.992
  },
  {
   "section": "slot2",
   "text": "And in that time, I've got it wrong in almost every way available.",
   "start": 26.252,
   "end": 30.382
  },
  {
   "section": "slot2",
   "text": "Two hours, queuing to get out of a car park.",
   "start": 31.082,
   "end": 33.957
  },
  {
   "section": "slot2",
   "text": "An entire display, facing straight into the sun.",
   "start": 34.217,
   "end": 37.504
  },
  {
   "section": "slot2",
   "text": "And I'm a train driver.",
   "start": 38.204,
   "end": 39.825
  },
  {
   "section": "slot2",
   "text": "Who once missed the last train home.",
   "start": 40.525,
   "end": 42.752
  },
  {
   "section": "reveal",
   "text": "So I've built a website.",
   "start": 44.4,
   "end": 46.087
  },
  {
   "section": "reveal",
   "text": "I know. Try to contain yourselves.",
   "start": 46.787,
   "end": 48.966
  },
  {
   "section": "map",
   "text": "This is the map. Every U K airshow I know of, colour coded by type.",
   "start": 54.3,
   "end": 59.079
  },
  {
   "section": "map",
   "text": "Because I'm that sort of person.",
   "start": 59.629,
   "end": 61.706
  },
  {
   "section": "guide",
   "text": "Thirteen of them get a full guide. Where to park, where to sit, and where the sun will be.",
   "start": 62.2,
   "end": 67.752
  },
  {
   "section": "guide",
   "text": "Which matters more than you'd think.",
   "start": 68.012,
   "end": 70.33
  },
  {
   "section": "buses",
   "text": "Then there are the buses. Fifty four of them, mapped, stop by stop.",
   "start": 74.3,
   "end": 78.592
  },
  {
   "section": "buses",
   "text": "I'd like to tell you this was tedious.",
   "start": 78.852,
   "end": 81.255
  },
  {
   "section": "buses",
   "text": "It wasn't. I loved it.",
   "start": 81.955,
   "end": 83.689
  },
  {
   "section": "cams",
   "text": "There are three D models of eleven cameras, so you can learn every button.",
   "start": 86.3,
   "end": 90.929
  },
  {
   "section": "cams",
   "text": "Even the ones nobody has ever pressed.",
   "start": 91.479,
   "end": 94.05
  },
  {
   "section": "plan",
   "text": "Camping. First timers. Rainy days. Doing the whole thing on a budget.",
   "start": 96.2,
   "end": 100.683
  },
  {
   "section": "plan",
   "text": "All covered.",
   "start": 100.943,
   "end": 101.921
  },
  {
   "section": "forum",
   "text": "And there's a forum, where people who care about this as much as I do can discuss it.",
   "start": 106.3,
   "end": 111.646
  },
  {
   "section": "forum",
   "text": "At length.",
   "start": 112.196,
   "end": 113.102
  },
  {
   "section": "slot3",
   "text": "Now.",
   "start": 114.6,
   "end": 115.3
  },
  {
   "section": "slot3",
   "text": "I write every page of this, and I keep it checked right through the season.",
   "start": 116.0,
   "end": 120.411
  },
  {
   "section": "slot3",
   "text": "But it's grown a bit beyond one bloke in a field.",
   "start": 120.671,
   "end": 123.923
  },
  {
   "section": "slot3",
   "text": "There's a team now. And there's room for you.",
   "start": 124.183,
   "end": 126.93
  },
  {
   "section": "slot3",
   "text": "Bring a chair.",
   "start": 128.33,
   "end": 129.415
  },
  {
   "section": "end",
   "text": "It's free, it always will be, and it's at U K airshow guide dot co dot U K.",
   "start": 136.0,
   "end": 141.299
  },
  {
   "section": "end",
   "text": "Subscribe, if you like.",
   "start": 141.559,
   "end": 143.331
  },
  {
   "section": "end",
   "text": "I won't be offended if you don't.",
   "start": 143.581,
   "end": 145.809
  },
  {
   "section": "end",
   "text": "Much.",
   "start": 146.509,
   "end": 147.173
  }
 ]
}